0$\n($\\approx 0.99220$) — the imaginary (depth-partner) component is\ngenuinely present. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness.cl3_2pi5_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness.cl3_2pi5_pos","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BringTrilogDepth3Witness.lean#L78-L78","doc":"Witness-pinned non-degeneracy: $\\mathrm{Cl}_3(2\\pi/5) > 0$\n($\\approx 0.18937$). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness.orbit_sum_real","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness.orbit_sum_real","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BringTrilogDepth3Witness.lean#L75-L75","doc":"**K = 5 distribution relation, real part** (the falsifiable,\n50-dps cross-validated content): the full 4-term orbit sum\n$\\sum_{k=1}^{4} \\mathrm{Cl}_3(2\\pi k/5)\n= 2(\\mathrm{Cl}_3(2\\pi/5) + \\mathrm{Cl}_3(4\\pi/5))$ equals the\nproved closed form $-(24/25)\\,\\zeta(3)$\n(`Cl3Zeta5OrbitSum.orbit_sum_identity`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness.s3_4pi5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness.s3_4pi5","kind":"def","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BringTrilogDepth3Witness.lean#L68-L68","doc":"$S_3(4\\pi/5) = \\mathrm{Im}\\,\\mathrm{Li}_3(\\zeta_5^2)$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness.cl3_4pi5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness.cl3_4pi5","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BringTrilogDepth3Witness.lean#L66-L66","doc":"$\\mathrm{Cl}_3(4\\pi/5) = \\mathrm{Re}\\,\\mathrm{Li}_3(\\zeta_5^2)$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness.s3_2pi5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness.s3_2pi5","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BringTrilogDepth3Witness.lean#L64-L64","doc":"$S_3(2\\pi/5) = \\mathrm{Im}\\,\\mathrm{Li}_3(\\zeta_5)$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness.cl3_2pi5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness.cl3_2pi5","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BringTrilogDepth3Witness.lean#L62-L62","doc":"$\\mathrm{Cl}_3(2\\pi/5) = \\mathrm{Re}\\,\\mathrm{Li}_3(\\zeta_5)$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness.zeta3_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness.zeta3_pos","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BringTrilogDepth3Witness.lean#L60-L60","doc":"$\\zeta(3) > 0$ (archimedean input; $\\zeta(3) \\approx 1.20206$). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness.zeta3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness.zeta3","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BringTrilogDepth3Witness.lean#L58-L58","doc":"$\\zeta(3)$ (carried; no Mathlib closed form). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness.mk","kind":"ctor","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BringTrilogDepth3Witness.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BringTrilogDepth3Witness","kind":"class","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BringTrilogDepth3Witness.lean#L49-L82","doc":"**Bring trilog at $\\zeta_5$ as depth-3 grouplike value** — §3b conjecture\nclass carrying the archimedean components and the K = 5 distribution\nrelation (50-dps cross-validated witness).\n\nConjectural class — see\n[`conj:bring-trilog-depth-3-witness`](../../../quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/bring-trilog-depth-3-witness.md). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:bring-trilog-depth-3-witness","label":"conj:bring-trilog-depth-3-witness","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/bring-trilog-depth-3-witness.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}